{
  "name": "PLAQUE -- text onto an existing STL",
  "scad": "src/plaque_text_on_base.scad",
  "outdir": "exports",
  "previewdir": "previews",
  "_notes": [
    "Every case imports art/test_base.stl, a stand-in plaque built by",
    "art/test_base.scad. It is deliberately awkward in the two ways a real CAD",
    "export is awkward: the origin sits at a CORNER, and a raised border means",
    "the bounding-box top (6.8mm) is NOT the face the lettering lands on",
    "(5.0mm). Anything that assumes 'top = bbox top' fails on it.",
    "",
    "max_bbox is the real test here, not body count. The plaque is 114.3 x",
    "76.2, so a render that stays inside that footprint is a render whose text",
    "landed ON the plaque. Text that runs off the edge grows the box, which is",
    "exactly what the wrong-origin case measures.",
    "",
    "wrong_origin is not a bug being enshrined -- it is the reported failure,",
    "reproduced. Told the wrong origin mode the generator puts the text half a",
    "plaque away: 25 loose bodies spanning 161.5mm. min_bbox asserts the",
    "failure is still real, so if the origin control is ever quietly broken the",
    "case stops failing and says so.",
    "",
    "The text cases carry a degenerate-face allowance. Unioning glyph outlines",
    "into a flat face makes CGAL insert vertices along a letter's straight",
    "stems, and a few of the resulting triangles are collinear. Checked on",
    "narrow_text_field: both offenders have all three vertices on one vertical",
    "line (x = -3.1735, z = 5.0, the lettering face), area exactly 0.0, and the",
    "mesh is watertight, winding-consistent, one body, Euler 2. Slicers drop",
    "them. Which cases produce them depends on where glyph coordinates land, so",
    "it is not predictable from the parameters -- hence an allowance rather",
    "than a per-case number."
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "raised_default",
      "params": {
        "base_file": "../art/test_base.stl",
        "plaque_w": 114.3,
        "plaque_h": 76.2,
        "base_top_z": 5.0
      },
      "expect": {
        "watertight": true,
        "bodies": 1,
        "max_bbox": [
          114.31,
          76.21,
          6.81
        ],
        "max_degenerate": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "recessed",
      "params": {
        "base_file": "../art/test_base.stl",
        "plaque_w": 114.3,
        "plaque_h": 76.2,
        "base_top_z": 5.0,
        "text_style": "Recessed"
      },
      "expect": {
        "watertight": true,
        "bodies": 1,
        "max_bbox": [
          114.31,
          76.21,
          6.81
        ],
        "max_degenerate": 8
      }
    },
    {
